  "NSW:goulburn:September": "Spring arrives progressively. Early spring carries frost risk but warmth increases.\r\n\r\nPlant tender crops by late October after frost passes. Sow: carrots, lettuce, roots. Succession sow.\r\n\r\nGrowth accelerates week by week.",
