  "NSW:wagga wagga:January": "Summer is milder. Growth steady but cool nights limit heat-lovers. Keep picking.\r\n\r\nStart brassica and lettuce seedlings indoors. Direct-sow carrots, beetroot, silverbeet, kale.\r\n\r\nWater deeply morning. Mulch heavily.",
  "NSW:wagga wagga:February": "Summer is milder. Growth steady but cool nights limit heat-lovers. Keep picking.\r\n\r\nStart brassica and lettuce seedlings indoors. Direct-sow carrots, beetroot, silverbeet, kale.\r\n\r\nWater deeply morning. Mulch heavily.",
  "NSW:wagga wagga:March": "Autumn transitions fast. Cool nights arrive, autumn crops thrive.\r\n\r\nPlant brassicas, lettuce, leeks, onions. Direct-sow roots, peas, spinach, beans. Garlic in April.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops promptly. Empty beds need compost.",
  "NSW:wagga wagga:April": "Autumn transitions fast. Cool nights arrive, autumn crops thrive.\r\n\r\nPlant brassicas, lettuce, leeks, onions. Direct-sow roots, peas, spinach, beans. Garlic in April.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops promptly. Empty beds need compost.",
