  "NT:tennant creek:January": "Heat builds intensely. Days long and hot. Summer crops produce but need deep watering.\r\n\r\nSow autumn crops early. Carrots, beets, brassicas, lettuce thrive as heat fades. Get in early.\r\n\r\nAfternoon shade helps. Mulch heavily. Water early morning.",
  "NT:tennant creek:February": "Heat builds intensely. Days long and hot. Summer crops produce but need deep watering.\r\n\r\nSow autumn crops early. Carrots, beets, brassicas, lettuce thrive as heat fades. Get in early.\r\n\r\nAfternoon shade helps. Mulch heavily. Water early morning.",
  "NT:tennant creek:March": "Autumn arrives. Heat releases, autumn crops thrive.\r\n\r\nPrime planting season. Brassicas, lettuce, roots, peas, beans establish strongly. Direct-sow freely.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops. Autumn is most productive season.",
  "NT:tennant creek:April": "Autumn arrives. Heat releases, autumn crops thrive.\r\n\r\nPrime planting season. Brassicas, lettuce, roots, peas, beans establish strongly. Direct-sow freely.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops. Autumn is most productive season.",
  "NT:tennant creek:May": "Autumn arrives. Heat releases, autumn crops thrive.\r\n\r\nPrime planting season. Brassicas, lettuce, roots, peas, beans establish strongly. Direct-sow freely.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops. Autumn is most productive season.",
  "NT:tennant creek:June": "Winter is cool but rarely harsh. Frosts rare.\r\n\r\nWinter crops grow steadily. Brassicas, lettuce, spinach, peas, beans, roots thrive. Peak harvest season.\r\n\r\nStart spring seedlings by August. Winter often easiest and most productive.",
  "NT:tennant creek:July": "Winter is cool but rarely harsh. Frosts rare.\r\n\r\nWinter crops grow steadily. Brassicas, lettuce, spinach, peas, beans, roots thrive. Peak harvest season.\r\n\r\nStart spring seedlings by August. Winter often easiest and most productive.",
  "NT:tennant creek:August": "Winter is cool but rarely harsh. Frosts rare.\r\n\r\nWinter crops grow steadily. Brassicas, lettuce, spinach, peas, beans, roots thrive. Peak harvest season.\r\n\r\nStart spring seedlings by August. Winter often easiest and most productive.",
  "NT:tennant creek:September": "Spring arrives and heat builds fast. Transition happens quickly.\r\n\r\nPlant spring crops early: tomatoes, capsicums, beans, squash before serious heat.\r\n\r\nMulch heavily. Afternoon shade valuable. Spring is brief.",
  "NT:tennant creek:October": "Spring arrives and heat builds fast. Transition happens quickly.\r\n\r\nPlant spring crops early: tomatoes, capsicums, beans, squash before serious heat.\r\n\r\nMulch heavily. Afternoon shade valuable. Spring is brief.",
