  "QLD:brisbane:January": "Summer warm but coastal moderation helps. Regular growth with good water management.\r\n\r\nSow autumn crops in warm soil. Carrots, beets, brassicas, lettuce establish quickly.\r\n\r\nDeep early morning watering prevents stress.",
