  "QLD:brisbane:March": "Autumn mild and extended by coastal protection. Excellent for cool-weather crops.\r\n\r\nPlant brassicas, lettuce, onions, leeks, roots. Direct-sow peas, beans, Asian greens. Garlic in April.\r\n\r\nAutumn is prime season.",
