  "QLD:dalby:January": "Summer production solid. Tomatoes, beans, cucumbers, zucchini, pumpkins grow well with consistent water. Pick regularly.\r\n\r\nSow autumn crops in warm soil: carrots, beets, brassicas, lettuce establish quickly.\r\n\r\nWater deeply morning. Mulch moderates temperature.",
  "QLD:dalby:February": "Summer production solid. Tomatoes, beans, cucumbers, zucchini, pumpkins grow well with consistent water. Pick regularly.\r\n\r\nSow autumn crops in warm soil: carrots, beets, brassicas, lettuce establish quickly.\r\n\r\nWater deeply morning. Mulch moderates temperature.",
  "QLD:dalby:March": "Autumn established. Prime time for cool-season crops: brassicas, lettuce, roots, peas, beans.\r\n\r\nPlant seedlings and direct-sow freely. Garlic in April. Everything grows steadily as temperatures cool.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops. Empty beds should be mulched.",
  "QLD:dalby:April": "Autumn established. Prime time for cool-season crops: brassicas, lettuce, roots, peas, beans.\r\n\r\nPlant seedlings and direct-sow freely. Garlic in April. Everything grows steadily as temperatures cool.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops. Empty beds should be mulched.",
