  "QLD:logan:June": "Winter is cool but rarely harsh. Frosts rare.\r\n\r\nWinter crops grow steadily. Brassicas, lettuce, spinach, peas, beans, roots thrive. Peak harvest season.\r\n\r\nStart spring seedlings by August. Winter often easiest and most productive.",
  "QLD:logan:July": "Winter is cool but rarely harsh. Frosts rare.\r\n\r\nWinter crops grow steadily. Brassicas, lettuce, spinach, peas, beans, roots thrive. Peak harvest season.\r\n\r\nStart spring seedlings by August. Winter often easiest and most productive.",
