  "QLD:logan:September": "Spring arrives and heat builds fast. Transition happens quickly.\r\n\r\nPlant spring crops early: tomatoes, capsicums, beans, squash before serious heat.\r\n\r\nMulch heavily. Afternoon shade valuable. Spring is brief.",
  "QLD:logan:October": "Spring arrives and heat builds fast. Transition happens quickly.\r\n\r\nPlant spring crops early: tomatoes, capsicums, beans, squash before serious heat.\r\n\r\nMulch heavily. Afternoon shade valuable. Spring is brief.",
