  "QLD:mount isa:January": "Heat builds intensely. Days long and hot. Summer crops produce but need deep watering.\r\n\r\nSow autumn crops early. Carrots, beets, brassicas, lettuce thrive as heat fades. Get in early.\r\n\r\nAfternoon shade helps. Mulch heavily. Water early morning.",
  "QLD:mount isa:February": "Heat builds intensely. Days long and hot. Summer crops produce but need deep watering.\r\n\r\nSow autumn crops early. Carrots, beets, brassicas, lettuce thrive as heat fades. Get in early.\r\n\r\nAfternoon shade helps. Mulch heavily. Water early morning.",
  "QLD:mount isa:March": "Autumn arrives. Heat releases, autumn crops thrive.\r\n\r\nPrime planting season. Brassicas, lettuce, roots, peas, beans establish strongly. Direct-sow freely.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops. Autumn is most productive season.",
  "QLD:mount isa:April": "Autumn arrives. Heat releases, autumn crops thrive.\r\n\r\nPrime planting season. Brassicas, lettuce, roots, peas, beans establish strongly. Direct-sow freely.\r\n\r\nClear summer crops. Autumn is most productive season.",
