  "SA:adelaide:January": "Summer is milder. Growth steady but cool nights limit heat-lovers. Keep picking.\r\n\r\nStart brassica and lettuce seedlings indoors. Direct-sow carrots, beetroot, silverbeet, kale.\r\n\r\nWater deeply morning. Mulch heavily.",
