  "VIC:ararat:June": "Winter is cool but manageable. Occasional frosts, not constant.\r\n\r\nWinter crops grow steadily. Spinach, kale, peas, beans, brassicas, roots produce regular harvest.\r\n\r\nStart spring seedlings by August. Use quiet winter for planning.",
  "VIC:ararat:July": "Winter is cool but manageable. Occasional frosts, not constant.\r\n\r\nWinter crops grow steadily. Spinach, kale, peas, beans, brassicas, roots produce regular harvest.\r\n\r\nStart spring seedlings by August. Use quiet winter for planning.",
